Preamble

This license establishes the terms under which a given free software
Package may be copied, modified, distributed, and/or redistributed.
The intent is that the Copyright Holder maintains some artistic
control over the development of that Package while still keeping the
Package available as open source and free software.

You are always permitted to make arrangements wholly outside of this
license directly with the Copyright Holder of a given Package. If the
terms of this license do not permit the full use that you propose to
make of the Package, you should contact the Copyright Holder and seek
a different licensing arrangement.

Definitions

    "Copyright Holder" means the individual(s) or organization(s) named
    in the copyright notice for the entire Package.

    "Contributor" means any party that has contributed code that gets
    used in this Package.

    "Distributable Code" means all of the real-world, non-developer,
    tools, data, and source code that's in the Package.

    "Package" means the collection of Distributable Code passed to
    you, plus any accompanying documentation.

    "Standard Version" refers to such a Package if it has not been
    modified, or has been modified in accordance with the consent of
    the Copyright Holder.

    "Modified Version" means such a Package, if it has been changed.

    "Consent" means the Copyright Holder has given explicit permission
    to do something that otherwise would not be permitted under this
    License.

    "Distributor" means any party that distributes the Package.

    "Maintainer" means whoever is designated as such by the Copyright
    Holder.

